<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · 模型外面那一圈里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>能交给确定性的，不交给概率性的</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 28, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "#0F6E56"}}>确定性 · computational</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", marginTop: 18}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· 测试</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· lint</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· 类型</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· schema</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 20}}>能重跑、能审计。</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 28, background: "rgba(163,45,45,0.06)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 22, color: "#A32D2D"}}>概率性 · inferential</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", marginTop: 18}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· AI review</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· 模型判断</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· 主观评分</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.9}}>· 感觉</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 20}}>换个时间可能换结论。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>15 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
